## A room with character

This double tucks its bed onto a mezzanine level, reached by a staircase in the room, which frees up the space below. You get the same comforts as the rest of the house: a walk-in shower, Nespresso coffee and free WiFi.

*Please note: the bed is on a mezzanine level, accessed by stairs.*
